{
    "title": "Memory Color - Paint by Number",
    "description": "Memory Color - The Game that Takes You on a Colorful Journey of Memories!\r\nEmbark on a magical journey of memories and colors with Memory Color, the ultimate coloring game. Let us guide you through a nostalgic adventure where you rediscover the joy of coloring and the beauty of colors that bring memories to life. Immerse yourself in a world of vibrant hues and unlock the power of colors to evoke cherished moments.\r\nMemory Color is not just a coloring game; it's a gateway to your happy memories. With its intuitive gameplay and captivating features, you'll experience the bliss of coloring like never before. Unleash your creativity as you paint by number, indulge in a variety of coloring books and pictures, and create stunning artworks that reflect your unique style. Let each stroke of color transport you to a time filled with happiness and warmth.\r\nFeaturing a vast collection of over 10,000 coloring pictures, Memory Color offers endless options for your artistic exploration. From soothing landscapes to intricate designs, you'll find a category that resonates with your soul. Rediscover the joy of coloring for adults and let the stress melt away as you immerse yourself in this therapeutic painting game.\r\nWith its user-friendly interface, Memory Color ensures a seamless and enjoyable coloring experience. Whether you're at home, on the go, or taking a break, simply open the app and let the colors flow, bringing your memories to life one shade at a time.\r\nDiscover new art and immerse yourself in more than 20 popular categories, including Girls, Fantasy, Animals, Cottage, Travel, Flowers, Heart, Mandalas, Interior, Water Color, Oil, Nature, Princess, Holiday, Glitters, Portrait, Illustration, Food, and Kids. There's something to suit every taste and preference.\r\nWe are committed to providing you with the best coloring experience ever. Here are some amazing features you can enjoy:\r\n\ud83d\udd25 Paint easily by number: Simply tap the numbers in order and watch your artwork come to life.\r\n\ud83c\udfa8 Every picture is a masterpiece: We've handpicked each picture to ensure an enjoyable coloring experience every time.\r\n\ud83c\udd95 Daily new artworks: Never run out of inspiration! We add fresh and exciting pictures every day to keep your coloring experience thrilling.\r\n\ud83d\ude0d Smooth interface: Enjoy a seamless and immersive coloring experience with stunning animations.\r\nDownload Memory Color now and unleash your inner artist! Color by number whenever and wherever you want. Experience the incredible sense of accomplishment in the most delightful coloring game ever! \ud83e\udd70\r\nWe value your feedback! If you have any suggestions or questions, please reach out to us at mimintgames@gmail.com. We are here to make your coloring journey even more awesome !",
    "descriptionHTML": "Memory Color - The Game that Takes You on a Colorful Journey of Memories!<br>Embark on a magical journey of memories and colors with Memory Color, the ultimate coloring game. Let us guide you through a nostalgic adventure where you rediscover the joy of coloring and the beauty of colors that bring memories to life. Immerse yourself in a world of vibrant hues and unlock the power of colors to evoke cherished moments.<br>Memory Color is not just a coloring game; it&#39;s a gateway to your happy memories. With its intuitive gameplay and captivating features, you&#39;ll experience the bliss of coloring like never before. Unleash your creativity as you paint by number, indulge in a variety of coloring books and pictures, and create stunning artworks that reflect your unique style. Let each stroke of color transport you to a time filled with happiness and warmth.<br>Featuring a vast collection of over 10,000 coloring pictures, Memory Color offers endless options for your artistic exploration. From soothing landscapes to intricate designs, you&#39;ll find a category that resonates with your soul. Rediscover the joy of coloring for adults and let the stress melt away as you immerse yourself in this therapeutic painting game.<br>With its user-friendly interface, Memory Color ensures a seamless and enjoyable coloring experience. Whether you&#39;re at home, on the go, or taking a break, simply open the app and let the colors flow, bringing your memories to life one shade at a time.<br>Discover new art and immerse yourself in more than 20 popular categories, including Girls, Fantasy, Animals, Cottage, Travel, Flowers, Heart, Mandalas, Interior, Water Color, Oil, Nature, Princess, Holiday, Glitters, Portrait, Illustration, Food, and Kids. There&#39;s something to suit every taste and preference.<br>We are committed to providing you with the best coloring experience ever. Here are some amazing features you can enjoy:<br>\ud83d\udd25 Paint easily by number: Simply tap the numbers in order and watch your artwork come to life.<br>\ud83c\udfa8 Every picture is a masterpiece: We&#39;ve handpicked each picture to ensure an enjoyable coloring experience every time.<br>\ud83c\udd95 Daily new artworks: Never run out of inspiration! We add fresh and exciting pictures every day to keep your coloring experience thrilling.<br>\ud83d\ude0d Smooth interface: Enjoy a seamless and immersive coloring experience with stunning animations.<br>Download Memory Color now and unleash your inner artist! Color by number whenever and wherever you want. Experience the incredible sense of accomplishment in the most delightful coloring game ever! \ud83e\udd70<br>We value your feedback! If you have any suggestions or questions, please reach out to us at mimintgames@gmail.com. We are here to make your coloring journey even more awesome !",
